Location: Beverly Beach Welcome Center
Host Assignment: Visitor Center Host(s)
Dates Needed: April 1st-30th, 2025
Site/Shift Details: C02, working  2-6pm Sunday-Thursday,  OFF Friday + Satu=
rday

Brief Position Description: The Welcome Center at Beverly Beach Campground =
is focused on firewood and ice sales while providing informative conversati=
on to the public about the campground, surrounding area and other visitor n=
eeds. Some interpretation offered in the yurt, but not a requirement to ref=
erence.

  *   Greet visitors and field questions about area/park/nearby resources
  *   Operate POYNT credit card sales system for selling firewood, ice, and=
 other park merchandise
  *   Cash handling and preforming OPRD revenue reconciliation procedures
  *   Assist in daily cleaning in the building (ex: vacuuming, dusting, san=
itizing surfaces)
  *   Restock Firewood cabinet and wheelbarrow
  *   Operate trash compactor and organize Recycling Center
Physical Requirements of this position include:

  *   Serve as a visible and professional representative of the park
  *   Answer questions and give information to the public
  *   Attend monthly host orientation and mid-month safety meeting
  *   Complete all safety modules, background check, and annual required pa=
perwork
About the park/site: Your campsite, located at Beverly Beach State Park, of=
fers both 30 and 50amp electrical/water/sewer hook-ups.  There are on-site =
laundry facilities. Cell/internet service is limited within park.  Ongoing =
campground projects include paving service road, re-doing laundry facilitie=
s (laundry units still operational).

Contact: Paiute Morrison, Beverly Beach VSL (Host Coordinator).  Email me s=
eparately (not on this thread) at paiute.morrison@oprd.oregon.gov<mailto:pa=
iute.morrison@oprd.oregon.gov> or call 541-270-2628 Wednesday-Sunday (9am-3=
pm) if interested or have any questions. Thank you.



