<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Location</b>: Beverly Beach Welcome Center<o:p></=
o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Host Assignment:</b>&nbsp;Visitor Center Host(s)<=
o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Dates Needed: <span style=3D"background:yellow;ms=
o-highlight:yellow">
April 1<sup>st</sup>-30<sup>th</sup>, 2025</span><o:p></o:p></b></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Site/Shift Details: C02, working &nbsp;2-6pm Sund=
ay-Thursday, &nbsp;OFF Friday + Saturday<o:p></o:p></b></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Brief Position Description:</b>&nbsp;The Welcome =
Center at Beverly Beach Campground is focused on firewood and ice sales whi=
le providing informative conversation to the public about the campground, s=
urrounding area and other visitor needs.
 Some interpretation offered in the yurt, but not a requirement to referenc=
e.<o:p></o:p></p>
<ul style=3D"margin-top:0in" type=3D"disc">
<li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Greet visitors an=
d field questions about area/park/nearby resources<o:p></o:p></li><li class=
=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Operate POYNT credit card =
sales system for selling firewood, ice, and other park merchandise<o:p></o:=
p></li><li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Cash handl=
ing and preforming OPRD revenue reconciliation procedures<o:p></o:p></li><l=
i class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Assist in daily cle=
aning in the building (ex: vacuuming, dusting, sanitizing surfaces)<o:p></o=
:p></li><li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Restock F=
irewood cabinet and wheelbarrow<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3D"MsoNormal" styl=
e=3D"mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">Operate trash compactor and organize Recyclin=
g Center<o:p></o:p></li></ul>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Physical Requirements of this position include:&n=
bsp;</b><o:p></o:p></p>
<ul style=3D"margin-top:0in" type=3D"disc">
<li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2">Serve as a visibl=
e and professional representative of the park<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3D"M=
soNormal" style=3D"mso-list:l1 level1 lfo2">Answer questions and give infor=
mation to the public<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-li=
st:l1 level1 lfo2">Attend monthly host orientation and mid-month safety mee=
ting<o:p></o:p></li><li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-list:l1 level1 lfo=
2">Complete all safety modules, background check, and annual required paper=
work<o:p></o:p></li></ul>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>About the park/site:</b>&nbsp;Your campsite, loca=
ted at Beverly Beach State Park, offers both 30 and 50amp electrical/water/=
sewer hook-ups.&nbsp; There are on-site laundry facilities. Cell/internet s=
ervice is limited within park.&nbsp; Ongoing campground
 projects include paving service road, re-doing laundry facilities (laundry=
 units still operational).
<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><b>Contact:</b> Paiute Morrison, Beverly Beach VSL (=
Host Coordinator).&nbsp; Email me separately (not on this thread) at
<a href=3D"mailto:paiute.morrison@oprd.oregon.gov">paiute.morrison@oprd.ore=
gon.gov</a> or call 541-270-2628 Wednesday-Sunday (9am-3pm) if interested o=
r have any questions. Thank you.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
